# Rust 宿主的构建产物与 Tauri 自动生成的权限 schema。它们不是人写的代码，
# 交给 cargo 与 `tauri build` 自己管；格式化它们只会把 diff 变成噪音。
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Cargo.lock 由 cargo 写出，保持它的原始换行，不然每次构建都会重排一次。
src-tauri/Cargo.lock

# 图标目录里只有位图与 .ico，但 tauri icon 也会写一个 README，别去动它。
src-tauri/icons/

# Verbatim third-party data snapshots (see scripts/glossary/fetch-holidays.mjs).
# They must stay byte-identical to what the source published, or the tests no
# longer prove we read the published document.
tests/fixtures/chinese-days/*.json

# Verbatim public-domain source texts used for quote verification.
# They are historical transcriptions; reformatting them would alter the text
# the glossary quotes are checked against.
tests/fixtures/*/*.txt
